.TH L10N-CONV 1 "February 2026" "l10n-conv 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
l10n-conv \- universal localization file converter, validator, and compiler
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B l10n-conv
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
l10n-conv converts, validates, and compiles localization files across 16+ formats
including Gettext PO/MO, Qt TS/QM, XLIFF, Android XML, iOS Strings, JSON, YAML,
and many more.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B convert \fIINPUT\fR [\-f FORMAT] [\-\-to FORMAT] [\-o OUTPUT]
Convert between localization formats. Auto-detects input format.
.TP
.B compile \fIINPUT\fR \-o \fIOUTPUT\fR
Compile PO\(->MO or TS\(->QM.
.TP
.B extract \fISOURCE_DIR\fR \-o \fIOUTPUT\fR
Extract translatable strings from source code (Python, C/C++, JS/TS, QML).
.TP
.B check \fIFILE\fR
Validate a localization file for issues.
.TP
.B stats \fIFILE\fR
Show translation statistics.
.TP
.B merge \fIBASE\fR \fIUPDATE\fR \-o \fIOUTPUT\fR
Merge two localization files.
.TP
.B diff \fIFILE1\fR \fIFILE2\fR
Show differences between two files.
.TP
.B init \fITEMPLATE\fR \-l \fILANG\fR \-o \fIOUTPUT\fR
Create a new language file from a template.
.TP
.B list-formats
List all supported input and output formats with descriptions.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Convert PO file to XLIFF:
.B l10n-conv convert messages.po --to xliff -o messages.xliff
.TP
Compile PO to MO:
.B l10n-conv compile messages.po -o messages.mo
.TP
Extract strings from Python source:
.B l10n-conv extract src/ -o messages.pot
.TP
Show statistics with JSON output:
.B l10n-conv stats messages.po --json
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-verbose
Show verbose output with detailed processing information.
.TP
.B \-j, \-\-json
Output results in JSON format for programmatic consumption.
.TP
.B \-q, \-\-quiet
Suppress non-essential output, showing only errors and final results.
.TP
.B \-\-about
Show detailed information about the application, supported formats,
and feature overview.
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Preview operations without actually writing any files to disk.
.TP
.B \-\-batch
Process directories recursively, handling multiple files automatically.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show version information and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Error.
.TP
.B 2
Warnings found.
